- row  `**`  anything, across segments  `.*`
- row  `?`  a single character within a segment  `[^/\\]`
- row  `[a-z]`, `[abc]`  one character of a range or a set  `[a-z]`, `[abc]`
- row  `[!a-z]`, `[!abc]`  one character outside a range or a set  `[^a-z]`, `[^abc]`
